(7252969, 1127515, 86447, '<td valign="top">Would you buy a print of this... if you saw it in a street fair?<br/> <br/>Or... a book shop?   Or... anywhere else?<br/> <br/>I wouldn''t.<br/> <br/>I hope it''s scoring well for you, but... it''s too ... weird for me.<br/> <br/>I do like the centered subject.  :D</td>', 'Would you buy a print of this... if you saw it in a street fair? Or... a book shop?   Or... anywhere else? I wouldn''t. I hope it''s scoring well for you, but... it''s too ... weird for me. I do like the centered subject.  :D', '2014-08-20 00:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7253212, 1127562, 177030, '<td valign="top">Perfection.  Love the detail in the sky and the way the eye flows through the image. For me, the umbrella works as an arrow with the dark area of the base and  gradient of the sky blending to darkness holding the observer in the image.</td>', 'Perfection.  Love the detail in the sky and the way the eye flows through the image. For me, the umbrella works as an arrow with the dark area of the base and  gradient of the sky blending to darkness holding the observer in the image.', '2014-08-20 13:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7253213, 1127542, 177030, '<td valign="top">Amazing detail and perfectly exposed.  The one green leaf seems a little out of place, but that is minor. Well done.</td>', 'Amazing detail and perfectly exposed.  The one green leaf seems a little out of place, but that is minor. Well done.', '2014-08-20 13:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7253214, 1127516, 177030, '<td valign="top">Nice capture and well spotted.  I like the grouping of the turbines and the way the light gradient match; where the turbines are spaced the furthest, the light is brightest and <i>vice aversa</i>. It helps guide the eye from left to right.</td>', 'Nice capture and well spotted.  I like the grouping of the turbines and the way the light gradient match; where the turbines are spaced the furthest, the light is brightest and vice aversa. It helps guide the eye from left to right.', '2014-08-20 13:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7253216, 1127279, 177030, '<td valign="top">Very effective use of the format.  Front page material.</td>', 'Very effective use of the format.  Front page material.', '2014-08-20 13:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7253217, 1127495, 177030, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and I like the top and bottom vignette.  I can''t decide if the cut off elbow is a problem or not. For this narrow format, you had to keep the body centered and that works very well. It''s all that "training'' that tells me not to cut off body parts. :-)</td>', 'Nicely composed and I like the top and bottom vignette.  I can''t decide if the cut off elbow is a problem or not. For this narrow format, you had to keep the body centered and that works very well. It''s all that "training'' that tells me not to cut off body parts. :-)', '2014-08-20 13:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7253219, 1127364, 177030, '<td valign="top">Has an oriental flare that works well for the subject.  I like the way the branch leads you through the image and the clean background.</td>', 'Has an oriental flare that works well for the subject.  I like the way the branch leads you through the image and the clean background.', '2014-08-20 13:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
