(7254295, 1127118, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lots to see and nice, curvy lines to lead the eye through the image.  The composition feels like it really suits this aspect ratio.</td>', 'Lots to see and nice, curvy lines to lead the eye through the image.  The composition feels like it really suits this aspect ratio.', '2014-08-23 21:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
