(7254359, 1127227, 94815, '<td valign="top">Good idea fits the frame.</td>', 'Good idea fits the frame.', '2014-08-24 00:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254360, 1127378, 94815, '<td valign="top">Effectively grey and timeless.marine panoramic.</td>', 'Effectively grey and timeless.marine panoramic.', '2014-08-24 00:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254361, 1127213, 94815, '<td valign="top">Good subject and framing for the topic. Anything musical gets my attention.</td>', 'Good subject and framing for the topic. Anything musical gets my attention.', '2014-08-24 00:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254366, 1127509, 94815, '<td valign="top">Perfect subject for the topic. I don''t know whether to chuckle at the presentation or feel sympathy for the unfortunate capsized boaters..</td>', 'Perfect subject for the topic. I don''t know whether to chuckle at the presentation or feel sympathy for the unfortunate capsized boaters..', '2014-08-24 00:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254369, 1127515, 94815, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of Francis Bacon''s painting of the pope.</td>', 'Reminds me of Francis Bacon''s painting of the pope.', '2014-08-24 00:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254372, 1127505, 94815, '<td valign="top">Bounteously golden. Good comp for the topic.Reminds me of one of those 19th cent French painters. Maybe Millet.</td>', 'Bounteously golden. Good comp for the topic.Reminds me of one of those 19th cent French painters. Maybe Millet.', '2014-08-24 00:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254373, 1127402, 94815, '<td valign="top">Good nighttime panoramic.</td>', 'Good nighttime panoramic.', '2014-08-24 00:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254375, 1127364, 94815, '<td valign="top">Good find, good composition and color although a bit overexposed to my eye.</td>', 'Good find, good composition and color although a bit overexposed to my eye.', '2014-08-24 00:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254390, 1127376, 60862, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid the bird doesn''t stand out enough from the background, especially at this size.  I also feel like this doesn''t really use the crop; it might have worked better as a vertical entry.</td>', 'I''m afraid the bird doesn''t stand out enough from the background, especially at this size.  I also feel like this doesn''t really use the crop; it might have worked better as a vertical entry.', '2014-08-24 01:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254391, 1127199, 60862, '<td valign="top">I feel like other entries really used the long side to good advantage. This is more of a normal aspect ratio, with the result that it''s such a small photo that I can''t see much.  Instead of saying "wow - cool use of a really long, thin photo," I want to see this enlarged.</td>', 'I feel like other entries really used the long side to good advantage. This is more of a normal aspect ratio, with the result that it''s such a small photo that I can''t see much.  Instead of saying "wow - cool use of a really long, thin photo," I want to see this enlarged.', '2014-08-24 01:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254394, 1127502, 60862, '<td valign="top">It''s interesting to me to compare this to my recent free study entry, which was a bee on a similar flower. There, I was able to use the much larger size to show the detail of these tiny subjects.  Here, I want to see more detail, more sharply, than what''s presented, and the image doesn''t really use the long, thin shape of the allowed aspect ratio.  I can''t really tell whether this would be a good shot at a larger size, but that''s part of my problem with this entry. Check out another macro entry in this challenge that shows a butterfly''s wings spread wide, or another one of a dragonfly''s long body.  Both of those really use the odd shape of the allowable crop.</td>', 'It''s interesting to me to compare this to my recent free study entry, which was a bee on a similar flower. There, I was able to use the much larger size to show the detail of these tiny subjects.  Here, I want to see more detail, more sharply, than what''s presented, and the image doesn''t really use the long, thin shape of the allowed aspect ratio.  I can''t really tell whether this would be a good shot at a larger size, but that''s part of my problem with this entry. Check out another macro entry in this challenge that shows a butterfly''s wings spread wide, or another one of a dragonfly''s long body.  Both of those really use the odd shape of the allowable crop.', '2014-08-24 01:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254395, 1127515, 60862, '<td valign="top">This is a tough one for me to score.  It doesn''t really appeal to me, and I don''t feel it really uses the long, thin aspect ratio very well.  But that said, I hope it meets *your* artistic vision.  If so, then you should be happy! :)</td>', 'This is a tough one for me to score.  It doesn''t really appeal to me, and I don''t feel it really uses the long, thin aspect ratio very well.  But that said, I hope it meets *your* artistic vision.  If so, then you should be happy! :)', '2014-08-24 01:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254396, 1127548, 60862, '<td valign="top">This shot takes advantage of the long, thin shape of the challenge''s aspect ratio, but I have to say it just doesn''t grab me.  As always, though, the relevant question is: does it grab *you*?</td>', 'This shot takes advantage of the long, thin shape of the challenge''s aspect ratio, but I have to say it just doesn''t grab me.  As always, though, the relevant question is: does it grab *you*?', '2014-08-24 01:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254397, 1127409, 60862, '<td valign="top">You did a nice job of using the aspect ratio.  I think with different editing, or maybe different shooting choices, this could have some real pop.  But for me, the dull colors and low contrast rob it of potential impact.</td>', 'You did a nice job of using the aspect ratio.  I think with different editing, or maybe different shooting choices, this could have some real pop.  But for me, the dull colors and low contrast rob it of potential impact.', '2014-08-24 01:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254398, 1127568, 60862, '<td valign="top">I like the shapes and patterns, but ultimately, they don''t grab me all that much.  I do think it''d hit me more if the space to the right were reduced significantly or even eliminated, so the right side of the sign were on the right edge of the photo.</td>', 'I like the shapes and patterns, but ultimately, they don''t grab me all that much.  I do think it''d hit me more if the space to the right were reduced significantly or even eliminated, so the right side of the sign were on the right edge of the photo.', '2014-08-24 01:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254399, 1127378, 60862, '<td valign="top">I like how you used the space, but the low contrast is leaving me wanting more pop.  I also think it''d work better with less space on the right to pull the bird toward that side.  I realize that there''s a limit to how much you can take away given the long crop requirements in this challenge.</td>', 'I like how you used the space, but the low contrast is leaving me wanting more pop.  I also think it''d work better with less space on the right to pull the bird toward that side.  I realize that there''s a limit to how much you can take away given the long crop requirements in this challenge.', '2014-08-24 01:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254401, 1127117, 60862, '<td valign="top">I like how the title matches the photo.  However, I''m not crazy about the subject being centered vertically; I keep wanting something interesting to be above or below the car. I''d probably like it better even with just white above the car, but nothing below the car.so my eye is drawn down to the subject,</td>', 'I like how the title matches the photo.  However, I''m not crazy about the subject being centered vertically; I keep wanting something interesting to be above or below the car. I''d probably like it better even with just white above the car, but nothing below the car.so my eye is drawn down to the subject,', '2014-08-24 01:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254402, 1127227, 60862, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the space, and some interesting lines and colors.  However, it doesn''t really pop for me.  But much more importantly, does it pop for *you*?</td>', 'Nice use of the space, and some interesting lines and colors.  However, it doesn''t really pop for me.  But much more importantly, does it pop for *you*?', '2014-08-24 01:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254403, 1127415, 60862, '<td valign="top">Good use of the long, thin shape this challenge requires.  However, the jumble of shapes and muted colors don''t do much for me.</td>', 'Good use of the long, thin shape this challenge requires.  However, the jumble of shapes and muted colors don''t do much for me.', '2014-08-24 01:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254404, 1127234, 60862, '<td valign="top">This makes me want to see the full curve.  I wonder if it might work better with the entire moon.  However, a circle doesn''t strike me as a natural fit to the long, thin shape this challenge enforces.</td>', 'This makes me want to see the full curve.  I wonder if it might work better with the entire moon.  However, a circle doesn''t strike me as a natural fit to the long, thin shape this challenge enforces.', '2014-08-24 01:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254405, 1127099, 60862, '<td valign="top">A good use of the photo''s shape to draw my eye through the various parts.  However, without a strong subject, I''m left without something to focus on, and wondering what the thing is at the bottom.<br/> <br/>Also, why the black bars on top and bottom?  I don''t think they''re needed.</td>', 'A good use of the photo''s shape to draw my eye through the various parts.  However, without a strong subject, I''m left without something to focus on, and wondering what the thing is at the bottom. Also, why the black bars on top and bottom?  I don''t think they''re needed.', '2014-08-24 01:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254406, 1127547, 60862, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of the gator, but I feel it doesn''t really take advantage of the long, thin shape this challenge encouraged.  Does it work to crop it tighter, with less visible above the gator? Doing that would also enlarge the gator, giving me more of the interesting shapes of its body, legs, and skin to explore. It''s also pretty low contrast, leaving me without that "wow" feeling.</td>', 'Nice shot of the gator, but I feel it doesn''t really take advantage of the long, thin shape this challenge encouraged.  Does it work to crop it tighter, with less visible above the gator? Doing that would also enlarge the gator, giving me more of the interesting shapes of its body, legs, and skin to explore. It''s also pretty low contrast, leaving me without that "wow" feeling.', '2014-08-24 01:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254407, 1127527, 60862, '<td valign="top">still life.  Given the long shape, I''d like it better if I could dive into the texture of fewer lemons.  I''m wondering what a really tight crops on 3 or 4 would look like.  Also, careful about the exposure: ordinarily, a few hot spots wouldn''t bother me, but since I''m craving texture here, those blown-out areas diminish my interest.</td>', 'still life.  Given the long shape, I''d like it better if I could dive into the texture of fewer lemons.  I''m wondering what a really tight crops on 3 or 4 would look like.  Also, careful about the exposure: ordinarily, a few hot spots wouldn''t bother me, but since I''m craving texture here, those blown-out areas diminish my interest.', '2014-08-24 01:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254408, 1127565, 60862, '<td valign="top">Good use of the long shape of this challenge''s aspect ratio.  However, the photo doesn''t really give me much to focus on, and I''m left wanting to see either a bigger view, showing me where they are, or a tighter one, allowing me to explore one or two bikers.</td>', 'Good use of the long shape of this challenge''s aspect ratio.  However, the photo doesn''t really give me much to focus on, and I''m left wanting to see either a bigger view, showing me where they are, or a tighter one, allowing me to explore one or two bikers.', '2014-08-24 01:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254409, 1127571, 60862, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the space, and there''s plenty to explore visually.  However, the low contrast leaves me wanting more pop, which would also really bring out the shapes and patterns.</td>', 'Nice use of the space, and there''s plenty to explore visually.  However, the low contrast leaves me wanting more pop, which would also really bring out the shapes and patterns.', '2014-08-24 01:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254410, 1127231, 60862, '<td valign="top">Good macro!  The lack of visual separation between the spider and the flower leaves me a little less wowed, though.  I can imagine you sitting there trying to figure out how to crop it, since the spider''s face is clearly the central focal point, but the spider''s legs are asymmetrical: put the spider''s face in the middle and lose some of the legs on the left or keep the whole spider in there and lose the symmetry?  I''m not sure there''s a perfect answer, but I''ll tell you this: I repeatedly found myself zooming my screen in so I could explore its face.  You seem to have captured lots of good detail there, but the choice to show its whole body, combined with the small size required by the challenge, meant I couldn''t see it well.</td>', 'Good macro!  The lack of visual separation between the spider and the flower leaves me a little less wowed, though.  I can imagine you sitting there trying to figure out how to crop it, since the spider''s face is clearly the central focal point, but the spider''s legs are asymmetrical: put the spider''s face in the middle and lose some of the legs on the left or keep the whole spider in there and lose the symmetry?  I''m not sure there''s a perfect answer, but I''ll tell you this: I repeatedly found myself zooming my screen in so I could explore its face.  You seem to have captured lots of good detail there, but the choice to show its whole body, combined with the small size required by the challenge, meant I couldn''t see it well.', '2014-08-24 01:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254412, 1127570, 60862, '<td valign="top">Interesting, artsy image, and it connects well with the title. It''s just not grabbing my attention.  Still, I''m giving it a 6 for visual interest a clear artistic vision.</td>', 'Interesting, artsy image, and it connects well with the title. It''s just not grabbing my attention.  Still, I''m giving it a 6 for visual interest a clear artistic vision.', '2014-08-24 01:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254413, 1127419, 60862, '<td valign="top">I feel caught between two different ways I''d prefer this: a wider view showing me something about the paper and a tighter macro, probably with a different angle on the lighting to bring out the interesting shapes and depth of the ridges and bumps.</td>', 'I feel caught between two different ways I''d prefer this: a wider view showing me something about the paper and a tighter macro, probably with a different angle on the lighting to bring out the interesting shapes and depth of the ridges and bumps.', '2014-08-24 01:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254414, 1127579, 60862, '<td valign="top">You used the long shape well, but the scene isn''t too interesting to me.  Maybe it''d grab me more with higher contrast, or a brighter foreground, or something to look at in the foreground?  I''m sorry I can''t give you more specifics.</td>', 'You used the long shape well, but the scene isn''t too interesting to me.  Maybe it''d grab me more with higher contrast, or a brighter foreground, or something to look at in the foreground?  I''m sorry I can''t give you more specifics.', '2014-08-24 01:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254415, 1127465, 60862, '<td valign="top">Interesting set of objects to explore.   You used the long skinny shape well, although I''m caught between admiring it as an abstract and wanting to know what the shiny thing is at the bottom (I''m guessing it''s a car).</td>', 'Interesting set of objects to explore.   You used the long skinny shape well, although I''m caught between admiring it as an abstract and wanting to know what the shiny thing is at the bottom (I''m guessing it''s a car).', '2014-08-24 01:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254416, 1127591, 60862, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure the bit of gray sky is adding to the photo. As I write this comment, I''m scrolled down so that only the building is visible, and I definitely like it more that way.  I think the shapes are interesting, and you used the long skinny shape of the image well.  But I find myself wanting more contrast - blacker blacks and whiter whites.</td>', 'I''m not sure the bit of gray sky is adding to the photo. As I write this comment, I''m scrolled down so that only the building is visible, and I definitely like it more that way.  I think the shapes are interesting, and you used the long skinny shape of the image well.  But I find myself wanting more contrast - blacker blacks and whiter whites.', '2014-08-24 01:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254417, 1127357, 60862, '<td valign="top">Nice use of color and shape, and a good use of the available photo shape given the required narrow crop.</td>', 'Nice use of color and shape, and a good use of the available photo shape given the required narrow crop.', '2014-08-24 01:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254418, 1127509, 60862, '<td valign="top">Great, funny title and a good use of the photo''s long shape.  Black and white gives this an "old fashioned summer fun" feel, too.  However, it''s hard to tell what this is given the extreme dark tones on all the kids'' heads.  I wonder what it looks like in color?</td>', 'Great, funny title and a good use of the photo''s long shape.  Black and white gives this an "old fashioned summer fun" feel, too.  However, it''s hard to tell what this is given the extreme dark tones on all the kids'' heads.  I wonder what it looks like in color?', '2014-08-24 01:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254420, 1127364, 60862, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of the long photo shape, well-place subject, and pretty colors.</td>', 'Very nice use of the long photo shape, well-place subject, and pretty colors.', '2014-08-24 01:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254422, 1127127, 60862, '<td valign="top">I really enjoyed the visual surprise of this photo.  At first I thought it was a landscape, then realized what I was looking at, which was then reinforced by the title.  Good use of composition and the long shape of the photo, too.</td>', 'I really enjoyed the visual surprise of this photo.  At first I thought it was a landscape, then realized what I was looking at, which was then reinforced by the title.  Good use of composition and the long shape of the photo, too.', '2014-08-24 01:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254424, 1127499, 60862, '<td valign="top">Very good textures and shapes. I think I''d like it even better with a little more contrast. Also, you used the long, skinny aspect ratio really well.</td>', 'Very good textures and shapes. I think I''d like it even better with a little more contrast. Also, you used the long, skinny aspect ratio really well.', '2014-08-24 01:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254425, 1127559, 60862, '<td valign="top">Good use of the photo''s shape and I like your composition.  I also appreciate the unusual subject.</td>', 'Good use of the photo''s shape and I like your composition.  I also appreciate the unusual subject.', '2014-08-24 01:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254426, 1127526, 60862, '<td valign="top">Very pretty!  Nice job finding a way to fill the long, thin photo with what sees to be a round flower.</td>', 'Very pretty!  Nice job finding a way to fill the long, thin photo with what sees to be a round flower.', '2014-08-24 01:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254428, 1127478, 60862, '<td valign="top">You did a terrific job of filling this long, narrow photo with multiple round subjects.  The colors and shapes are very nice.  My only suggestion is to crop out the green space on the left.  You don''t have to use a full 800 pixels, or you could zoom in a bit more on the flowers.  But that''s minor; I voted this an 8.</td>', 'You did a terrific job of filling this long, narrow photo with multiple round subjects.  The colors and shapes are very nice.  My only suggestion is to crop out the green space on the left.  You don''t have to use a full 800 pixels, or you could zoom in a bit more on the flowers.  But that''s minor; I voted this an 8.', '2014-08-24 02:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254429, 1127514, 60862, '<td valign="top">Interesting, unusual way to use repeating shapes to fill the long frame.I like the choice of B&amp;W here, too.</td>', 'Interesting, unusual way to use repeating shapes to fill the long frame.I like the choice of B&W here, too.', '2014-08-24 02:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254430, 1127279, 60862, '<td valign="top">Love the layers of color in the sky and the nice, dark silhouette.  Great job filling the long photo, and very good composition choice.</td>', 'Love the layers of color in the sky and the nice, dark silhouette.  Great job filling the long photo, and very good composition choice.', '2014-08-24 02:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254433, 1127059, 60862, '<td valign="top">Strong emotion conveyed through a very pretty image. My only concern is the large dark space at the bottom, which seems to rob it of the light feeling of the joyous pose.  When I zoom way in, I can it''s pebbles, but a combination of the narrow photo and the large gray expanse of the DPC background makes it look like a single black space at normal size. That''s minor, though; I voted this an 8.</td>', 'Strong emotion conveyed through a very pretty image. My only concern is the large dark space at the bottom, which seems to rob it of the light feeling of the joyous pose.  When I zoom way in, I can it''s pebbles, but a combination of the narrow photo and the large gray expanse of the DPC background makes it look like a single black space at normal size. That''s minor, though; I voted this an 8.', '2014-08-24 02:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254434, 1127235, 60862, '<td valign="top">Strong monochromatic composition, and I love how her pose mimics the light above.  Great use of the tall, skinny aspect ratio!</td>', 'Strong monochromatic composition, and I love how her pose mimics the light above.  Great use of the tall, skinny aspect ratio!', '2014-08-24 02:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254435, 1127027, 60862, '<td valign="top">Fascinating series of repeating shapes and textures, fit well into the long photo shape.</td>', 'Fascinating series of repeating shapes and textures, fit well into the long photo shape.', '2014-08-24 02:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254436, 1127346, 60862, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition with a lovely, soft color behind.  You used the shape of the photo very well to tell the story!</td>', 'Very nice composition with a lovely, soft color behind.  You used the shape of the photo very well to tell the story!', '2014-08-24 02:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254437, 1127505, 60862, '<td valign="top">A beautiful use of color and texture to fill the long photo.  My only quibble is that the sky is so skinny as to distract me with sort of a false top to the photo.  Still, an 8 from me!</td>', 'A beautiful use of color and texture to fill the long photo.  My only quibble is that the sky is so skinny as to distract me with sort of a false top to the photo.  Still, an 8 from me!', '2014-08-24 02:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254438, 1127406, 60862, '<td valign="top">Great use of the photo''s tall, skinny shape.  I like how the central line drives my eye downward with the interesting rivet pattern as a reward for exploring.</td>', 'Great use of the photo''s tall, skinny shape.  I like how the central line drives my eye downward with the interesting rivet pattern as a reward for exploring.', '2014-08-24 02:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254439, 1127550, 60862, '<td valign="top">Nicely shot and composed.  The subject stands out well and the background colors complement the dragonfly''s.  Compositionally, I think it might work better flipped horizontally. Here, my eye stops at the subject and everything to the right is kind of wasted space; with it flipped, my eye would travel naturally across the image to the dragonfly, and the green space would serve as a pathway to the subject.</td>', 'Nicely shot and composed.  The subject stands out well and the background colors complement the dragonfly''s.  Compositionally, I think it might work better flipped horizontally. Here, my eye stops at the subject and everything to the right is kind of wasted space; with it flipped, my eye would travel naturally across the image to the dragonfly, and the green space would serve as a pathway to the subject.', '2014-08-24 02:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254440, 1127569, 60862, '<td valign="top">Funny. :)  And yet still a good use of the space that''s well shot.</td>', 'Funny. :)  And yet still a good use of the space that''s well shot.', '2014-08-24 02:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254441, 1127496, 60862, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the format. I know you can''t control it in this shot, but I keep wanting to see details in each window.  I feel sort of like this is an excellent frame for really interesting stories in those window, but then I can''t explore those stories.</td>', 'Nice use of the format. I know you can''t control it in this shot, but I keep wanting to see details in each window.  I feel sort of like this is an excellent frame for really interesting stories in those window, but then I can''t explore those stories.', '2014-08-24 02:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254442, 1127587, 60862, '<td valign="top">Very pretty use of color and shape in the background to mirror and support the subject. I think I''d like it better with the bird on the right looking into the frame.  My eye tends to stop at the subject, leaving the empty space mostly wasted.  If it were on the right, it would not only lead me to the bird, but also hint at the shapes and colors I''d find there.</td>', 'Very pretty use of color and shape in the background to mirror and support the subject. I think I''d like it better with the bird on the right looking into the frame.  My eye tends to stop at the subject, leaving the empty space mostly wasted.  If it were on the right, it would not only lead me to the bird, but also hint at the shapes and colors I''d find there.', '2014-08-24 02:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254443, 1127422, 60862, '<td valign="top">Nice, wide view of the city.  Good job using the aspect ratio.</td>', 'Nice, wide view of the city.  Good job using the aspect ratio.', '2014-08-24 02:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254444, 1127581, 60862, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the long photo''s shape, reflected well in the bird''s outstretched wings.</td>', 'Nice use of the long photo''s shape, reflected well in the bird''s outstretched wings.', '2014-08-24 02:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254445, 1127495, 60862, '<td valign="top">Great tones and shapes.  If only her arm had fit, too.  But still, a good use of the narrow aspect ratio.</td>', 'Great tones and shapes.  If only her arm had fit, too.  But still, a good use of the narrow aspect ratio.', '2014-08-24 02:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254446, 1127516, 60862, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, good use of color and shape, nice contrast in the clouds.  And, ultimately, a very good choice for the odd photo shape in this challenge.  Bumping up the score.</td>', 'Very pretty, good use of color and shape, nice contrast in the clouds.  And, ultimately, a very good choice for the odd photo shape in this challenge.  Bumping up the score.', '2014-08-24 02:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254447, 1127386, 60862, '<td valign="top">Nice stack of ducks!  I like how they almost continuously come more into the frame as my eye works its way down the line.</td>', 'Nice stack of ducks!  I like how they almost continuously come more into the frame as my eye works its way down the line.', '2014-08-24 02:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254449, 1127508, 60862, '<td valign="top">Bumping this up.  I really like the different visual zones, the colors, and the shapes. The narrow photo shape makes it look like a story moving from civilization toward wilderness.</td>', 'Bumping this up.  I really like the different visual zones, the colors, and the shapes. The narrow photo shape makes it look like a story moving from civilization toward wilderness.', '2014-08-24 02:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254450, 1127396, 60862, '<td valign="top">So many interesting bits to explore in this, and you used the long photo shape so well that I don''t long for more. 9!</td>', 'So many interesting bits to explore in this, and you used the long photo shape so well that I don''t long for more. 9!', '2014-08-24 02:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254451, 1127405, 60862, '<td valign="top">Interesting people and nice tones.  B&amp;W was a good choice.</td>', 'Interesting people and nice tones.  B&W was a good choice.', '2014-08-24 02:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254452, 1127572, 60862, '<td valign="top">Good way to use the long shape of the photo. I could lose myself in her eyes, but something''s not completely pulling me in.  Maybe it''s that I''m wondering why she has something over her nose (and presumably her mouth)?  Maybe it''s that it''s not quite as tack-sharp as some other photos I''ve seen like this.  Maybe it''s the B&amp;W, so her eye color doesn''t draw me in.  What do *you* think of it?</td>', 'Good way to use the long shape of the photo. I could lose myself in her eyes, but something''s not completely pulling me in.  Maybe it''s that I''m wondering why she has something over her nose (and presumably her mouth)?  Maybe it''s that it''s not quite as tack-sharp as some other photos I''ve seen like this.  Maybe it''s the B&W, so her eye color doesn''t draw me in.  What do *you* think of it?', '2014-08-24 02:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254453, 1127542, 60862, '<td valign="top">Pretty use of shape and color to fill the narrow frame. I voted it a 7, but I''m having a hard time explaining why I didn''t vote it a 10.  I think maybe it''s a little low in contrast for my taste, and maybe it''s that I get enough of a hint of texture that I want to see more.</td>', 'Pretty use of shape and color to fill the narrow frame. I voted it a 7, but I''m having a hard time explaining why I didn''t vote it a 10.  I think maybe it''s a little low in contrast for my taste, and maybe it''s that I get enough of a hint of texture that I want to see more.', '2014-08-24 02:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254454, 1127371, 60862, '<td valign="top">Nice long subject to fill that narrow photo!  You captured the shapes and texture well, too.</td>', 'Nice long subject to fill that narrow photo!  You captured the shapes and texture well, too.', '2014-08-24 02:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254455, 1127488, 60862, '<td valign="top">Like an Edgar Allen Poe poem. At first I thought it was an E on a door, leaving me wondering what else is in the label.  Then I noticed the shadowy shape of the bird.  Very intriguing, and you composed it well with the subject at the bottom of the frame.</td>', 'Like an Edgar Allen Poe poem. At first I thought it was an E on a door, leaving me wondering what else is in the label.  Then I noticed the shadowy shape of the bird.  Very intriguing, and you composed it well with the subject at the bottom of the frame.', '2014-08-24 02:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254456, 1127584, 60862, '<td valign="top">A pretty scene that fills the frame well.  At this small size, though, I find myself wanting to see more detail in the shapes of the boats.  I think I''d like it better with some color difference between the various features of the photo.  Still, a 7.</td>', 'A pretty scene that fills the frame well.  At this small size, though, I find myself wanting to see more detail in the shapes of the boats.  I think I''d like it better with some color difference between the various features of the photo.  Still, a 7.', '2014-08-24 02:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254457, 1127533, 60862, '<td valign="top">A bold move to cut off the bird''s head. I like it as an abstract, but that choice about the head is distracting me.  Do *you* like it?</td>', 'A bold move to cut off the bird''s head. I like it as an abstract, but that choice about the head is distracting me.  Do *you* like it?', '2014-08-24 02:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254458, 1127435, 60862, '<td valign="top">This shot just delights me.  It starts out as a decent-enough city shot, but then I get the surprise of your legs.  Then, after reading the title, I notice the coffee cup and the mountain in the view.  Well done!</td>', 'This shot just delights me.  It starts out as a decent-enough city shot, but then I get the surprise of your legs.  Then, after reading the title, I notice the coffee cup and the mountain in the view.  Well done!', '2014-08-24 02:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254459, 1127507, 60862, '<td valign="top">You chose a good scene to fill the wide photo shape. I think it caught my attention a little less, though, because it''s hard to see much detail in the stuff on the ground.</td>', 'You chose a good scene to fill the wide photo shape. I think it caught my attention a little less, though, because it''s hard to see much detail in the stuff on the ground.', '2014-08-24 02:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254460, 1127398, 60862, '<td valign="top">Good choice from a composition standpoint.  However, as I do with most macros, I want to see lots of detail, and this small size makes that difficult. It''s hard to tell from this shot, but is it sharp enough to support cropping in almost entirely to the spider''s body?</td>', 'Good choice from a composition standpoint.  However, as I do with most macros, I want to see lots of detail, and this small size makes that difficult. It''s hard to tell from this shot, but is it sharp enough to support cropping in almost entirely to the spider''s body?', '2014-08-24 02:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254461, 1127466, 60862, '<td valign="top">As an abstract, the shapes and colors are interesting.  However, I can''t seem to let go of knowing those are windows and a tall ladder, and wanting to see more of them vertically.</td>', 'As an abstract, the shapes and colors are interesting.  However, I can''t seem to let go of knowing those are windows and a tall ladder, and wanting to see more of them vertically.', '2014-08-24 02:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254462, 1127451, 60862, '<td valign="top">A good use of the space, but the subject doesn''t much interest me.</td>', 'A good use of the space, but the subject doesn''t much interest me.', '2014-08-24 02:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254467, 1127547, 97225, '<td valign="top">Nice one! The gator''s shape makes him a natural for this challenge.</td>', 'Nice one! The gator''s shape makes him a natural for this challenge.', '2014-08-24 03:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254472, 1127562, 147314, '<td valign="top">My favourite this challenge. Fantastic way to deal with the 160px, very nice colours and I love that sky!</td>', 'My favourite this challenge. Fantastic way to deal with the 160px, very nice colours and I love that sky!', '2014-08-24 05:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254473, 1127586, 147314, '<td valign="top">Magnificent image, those wings are beautiful. Great colours as well.</td>', 'Magnificent image, those wings are beautiful. Great colours as well.', '2014-08-24 05:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254474, 1127526, 37858, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite three images.  I love how the subject matter suggests an entirely different image (as suggested by your title).  Excellent color and light use too.</td>', 'One of my favorite three images.  I love how the subject matter suggests an entirely different image (as suggested by your title).  Excellent color and light use too.', '2014-08-24 05:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254475, 1127562, 37858, '<td valign="top">My choice for the blue.  I just love the fly-away nature of her hair and the rather long handle on the umbrella, which to me suggests an upward motion enhanced by the upward sweep of the vertical frame.  Nice cloud details too.</td>', 'My choice for the blue.  I just love the fly-away nature of her hair and the rather long handle on the umbrella, which to me suggests an upward motion enhanced by the upward sweep of the vertical frame.  Nice cloud details too.', '2014-08-24 05:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254476, 1127279, 147314, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, those people enjoying that magnificent view, very DMC!</td>', 'Beautiful, those people enjoying that magnificent view, very DMC!', '2014-08-24 05:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254477, 1127549, 37858, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite three images.  Great bokeh and back light.  Focus is spot on too.</td>', 'One of my favorite three images.  Great bokeh and back light.  Focus is spot on too.', '2014-08-24 05:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254478, 1127516, 147314, '<td valign="top">Great find for this challenge. Lovely sky and colours.</td>', 'Great find for this challenge. Lovely sky and colours.', '2014-08-24 05:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254479, 1127550, 37858, '<td valign="top">Nicely done with pretty good detail and a fine blurred background.</td>', 'Nicely done with pretty good detail and a fine blurred background.', '2014-08-24 05:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254480, 1127549, 147314, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light, well done.</td>', 'Beautiful light, well done.', '2014-08-24 05:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254481, 1127526, 147314, '<td valign="top">Very inventive and well executed.</td>', 'Very inventive and well executed.', '2014-08-24 05:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254482, 1127581, 37858, '<td valign="top">If these guys only had voices I could imagine the one in flight barking out commands to the others.  The wing spread works with the frame size too.  The image seems a tad soft to me, though.  Still, I scored it well.</td>', 'If these guys only had voices I could imagine the one in flight barking out commands to the others.  The wing spread works with the frame size too.  The image seems a tad soft to me, though.  Still, I scored it well.', '2014-08-24 05:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254483, 1127283, 147314, '<td valign="top">Great image, nice leading lines pointing to that lonely person.</td>', 'Great image, nice leading lines pointing to that lonely person.', '2014-08-24 05:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254484, 1127542, 37858, '<td valign="top">Well done.  I especially like the light and shadow on several of the petals.</td>', 'Well done.  I especially like the light and shadow on several of the petals.', '2014-08-24 05:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254485, 1127586, 37858, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  Good detail, but it seems just a tad soft in the head area (but that could be my tired old eyes).</td>', 'Nicely done.  Good detail, but it seems just a tad soft in the head area (but that could be my tired old eyes).', '2014-08-24 05:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254486, 1127587, 37858, '<td valign="top">Lovely bokeh and good detail in the bird.  Good presentation as the off-center placement works for me, even though it is looking out of the frame rather than the more traditional placement that would have him looking toward the center.  Sometimes looking out the near frame just seems right...and this is one of those times IMHO.</td>', 'Lovely bokeh and good detail in the bird.  Good presentation as the off-center placement works for me, even though it is looking out of the frame rather than the more traditional placement that would have him looking toward the center.  Sometimes looking out the near frame just seems right...and this is one of those times IMHO.', '2014-08-24 05:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254487, 1127386, 37858, '<td valign="top">I like the way the ducks sort of stack up on one another in this vertical arrangement.</td>', 'I like the way the ducks sort of stack up on one another in this vertical arrangement.', '2014-08-24 05:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254488, 1127364, 37858, '<td valign="top">This has a sort of oriental feel to it, it seems to me, which I appreciate.  A very pleasing composition and nice detail.</td>', 'This has a sort of oriental feel to it, it seems to me, which I appreciate.  A very pleasing composition and nice detail.', '2014-08-24 05:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254489, 1127588, 37858, '<td valign="top">I like the subject matter and the action in this image.  It borders on being a panorama, which as I read the challenge rules is not the intended approach.  However, the blank space in the background skirts that issue because the focus is clearly on the runners.  Nice composition, well executed.</td>', 'I like the subject matter and the action in this image.  It borders on being a panorama, which as I read the challenge rules is not the intended approach.  However, the blank space in the background skirts that issue because the focus is clearly on the runners.  Nice composition, well executed.', '2014-08-24 05:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254490, 1127283, 37858, '<td valign="top">What''s not to like about this?  Great water, nice balance with the ferns on the right offsetting against the man and ferns on the left.  Well done.</td>', 'What''s not to like about this?  Great water, nice balance with the ferns on the right offsetting against the man and ferns on the left.  Well done.', '2014-08-24 05:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254491, 1127027, 37858, '<td valign="top">Good composition for a narrow frame like this.  The play of light and shadow is interesting too.</td>', 'Good composition for a narrow frame like this.  The play of light and shadow is interesting too.', '2014-08-24 05:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254492, 1127534, 37858, '<td valign="top">Fine composition.  It''s amazing that you could fit a stairwell into such a narrow, elongated frame.  Good range of tones too.  Well done, IMHO.</td>', 'Fine composition.  It''s amazing that you could fit a stairwell into such a narrow, elongated frame.  Good range of tones too.  Well done, IMHO.', '2014-08-24 05:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254493, 1127401, 37858, '<td valign="top">Good detail in the bird with a pleasing blur behind him.</td>', 'Good detail in the bird with a pleasing blur behind him.', '2014-08-24 05:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254494, 1127502, 37858, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot, but think the focus is just a tad too narrow as his back wing would have been nicer if sharper.  Still, the colors are good and the background blur is pleasing.  I scored it well, but it just missed being one of my favorites by the narrowest of margins.</td>', 'I like this a lot, but think the focus is just a tad too narrow as his back wing would have been nicer if sharper.  Still, the colors are good and the background blur is pleasing.  I scored it well, but it just missed being one of my favorites by the narrowest of margins.', '2014-08-24 05:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254495, 1127499, 37858, '<td valign="top">This fits the frame well.  The red dot on the upper leaf/pod is a bit distracting, but I guess I am nitpicking with that.</td>', 'This fits the frame well.  The red dot on the upper leaf/pod is a bit distracting, but I guess I am nitpicking with that.', '2014-08-24 05:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254496, 1127401, 147314, '<td valign="top">Funny, that tail in the right position for a 160px challenge.</td>', 'Funny, that tail in the right position for a 160px challenge.', '2014-08-24 05:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254497, 1127227, 37858, '<td valign="top">I wish there were more clouds in the sky so the glass would have more interest.</td>', 'I wish there were more clouds in the sky so the glass would have more interest.', '2014-08-24 05:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254498, 1127465, 147314, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection and great colours.</td>', 'Nice reflection and great colours.', '2014-08-24 05:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254499, 1127508, 37858, '<td valign="top">This is a fine image, with interest in the people in the foreground and on the river.  I''m not sure if the problem is my eyes or the image, but it seems to be a tad out of focus.  Certainly a beautiful setting for a photograph.</td>', 'This is a fine image, with interest in the people in the foreground and on the river.  I''m not sure if the problem is my eyes or the image, but it seems to be a tad out of focus.  Certainly a beautiful setting for a photograph.', '2014-08-24 05:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254501, 1127509, 37858, '<td valign="top">Uh-oh!  For the life of me, I can''t figure out what the subject matter of this image is, beyond the obvious presence of water.  I''m guessing that it is three children with floating devices at the edge of a pool, but I could be off by a mile.</td>', 'Uh-oh!  For the life of me, I can''t figure out what the subject matter of this image is, beyond the obvious presence of water.  I''m guessing that it is three children with floating devices at the edge of a pool, but I could be off by a mile.', '2014-08-24 05:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254502, 1127118, 37858, '<td valign="top">Nice collection of silhouettes and near-silhouettes in this landscape.  Processing seems a bit on the over-saturated or HDR side of things to me, but given the placement of the sun and the brightness of the water, I can see how this would be a more challenging image to process.  The composition, however, is very pleasing and I keep going from person to person and imagining their moods and conversations.</td>', 'Nice collection of silhouettes and near-silhouettes in this landscape.  Processing seems a bit on the over-saturated or HDR side of things to me, but given the placement of the sun and the brightness of the water, I can see how this would be a more challenging image to process.  The composition, however, is very pleasing and I keep going from person to person and imagining their moods and conversations.', '2014-08-24 05:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254504, 1127496, 37858, '<td valign="top">This is well-presented, with nice detail.  However, there isn''t much to interest me in the subject matter.  It would be more pleasing if someone was leaning out of one of the windows, or if curtains were blowing out a window, or some such thing.  I realize that you can''t create wasn''t isn''t present; I''m merely mentioning what I think holds this kind of image back from being a winner.  (Believe me, I do the same thing all the time.)</td>', 'This is well-presented, with nice detail.  However, there isn''t much to interest me in the subject matter.  It would be more pleasing if someone was leaning out of one of the windows, or if curtains were blowing out a window, or some such thing.  I realize that you can''t create wasn''t isn''t present; I''m merely mentioning what I think holds this kind of image back from being a winner.  (Believe me, I do the same thing all the time.)', '2014-08-24 05:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254506, 1127415, 37858, '<td valign="top">I think this is o.k., but there isn''t much to grab my attention or make me want to spend some time enjoying the image.  Just my two cents...trying to be helpful.</td>', 'I think this is o.k., but there isn''t much to grab my attention or make me want to spend some time enjoying the image.  Just my two cents...trying to be helpful.', '2014-08-24 05:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254508, 1127439, 37858, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition with a somewhat unorthodox scale.  The woman in the background seems awfully small, compared to the foreground woman with the phone (which is not a criticism - just an observation).  It grabs my attention.</td>', 'Interesting composition with a somewhat unorthodox scale.  The woman in the background seems awfully small, compared to the foreground woman with the phone (which is not a criticism - just an observation).  It grabs my attention.', '2014-08-24 05:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254509, 1127118, 147314, '<td valign="top">Looks familiar :-) Great lines again, but I find the processing less subtle.</td>', 'Looks familiar :-) Great lines again, but I find the processing less subtle.', '2014-08-24 05:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254510, 1127495, 37858, '<td valign="top">I guess I am not familiar enough with pearl jam (the musicians) to get the connection.  That''s not a fault of the photograph, though.  The dark face is a bit problematical for me as I would have liked to see a few more features.  Overall, though, it is an interesting presentation.</td>', 'I guess I am not familiar enough with pearl jam (the musicians) to get the connection.  That''s not a fault of the photograph, though.  The dark face is a bit problematical for me as I would have liked to see a few more features.  Overall, though, it is an interesting presentation.', '2014-08-24 05:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254511, 1127514, 37858, '<td valign="top">Nice use of repetition.</td>', 'Nice use of repetition.', '2014-08-24 06:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254512, 1127559, 37858, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what it is that I am looking at...but guess this is a slug or some similar critter.  The focus is a bit soft, which added to the problem for me.  However, I do find the image interesting.</td>', 'I''m not sure what it is that I am looking at...but guess this is a slug or some similar critter.  The focus is a bit soft, which added to the problem for me.  However, I do find the image interesting.', '2014-08-24 06:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254513, 1127478, 37858, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, pleasant composition.  The focus seems to be just a tad soft, though, and I find myself wishing there was a little more detail in the yellow areas of each flower.</td>', 'Nice idea, pleasant composition.  The focus seems to be just a tad soft, though, and I find myself wishing there was a little more detail in the yellow areas of each flower.', '2014-08-24 06:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254514, 1127532, 37858, '<td valign="top">Interesting wing-span.  Just right for this narrow frame.</td>', 'Interesting wing-span.  Just right for this narrow frame.', '2014-08-24 06:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254515, 1127235, 37858, '<td valign="top">Good repetition in the bent form of the light and person.</td>', 'Good repetition in the bent form of the light and person.', '2014-08-24 06:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254517, 1127405, 37858, '<td valign="top">An interesting combination of people.  This reminds me of the Winograd challenge of a few months back.</td>', 'An interesting combination of people.  This reminds me of the Winograd challenge of a few months back.', '2014-08-24 06:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254520, 1127127, 37858, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of the three trees cropped severely.  The tires, though, are not a very interesting subject matter for me.  Maybe if they were brought out a bit more instead of being relatively black and formless (especially on the left side of the image) the added detail would have cured the issue for me.  Just my 2 cents worth...trying to be helpful.</td>', 'I like the idea of the three trees cropped severely.  The tires, though, are not a very interesting subject matter for me.  Maybe if they were brought out a bit more instead of being relatively black and formless (especially on the left side of the image) the added detail would have cured the issue for me.  Just my 2 cents worth...trying to be helpful.', '2014-08-24 06:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254522, 1127098, 37858, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  It borders on being a panorama, which as I read the challenge is not the intent of the challenge.  Still, the emphasis on the sun and relatively little detail among the trees helps me skirt that issue.  Good color and mood too.</td>', 'Nice image.  It borders on being a panorama, which as I read the challenge is not the intent of the challenge.  Still, the emphasis on the sun and relatively little detail among the trees helps me skirt that issue.  Good color and mood too.', '2014-08-24 06:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254523, 1127591, 37858, '<td valign="top">Came back to bump this one up.  I like the detail of the reflection.</td>', 'Came back to bump this one up.  I like the detail of the reflection.', '2014-08-24 06:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254525, 1127371, 37858, '<td valign="top">Good color and detail.  What holds this image back is a lack of interest or context.  It''s not quite dramatic enough IMHO to get away with being an image about "form" or "light".  Granted, the nature of this odd challenge puts constraints on everyone, but some of the images others have presented still managed to add a bit more context or pop.  Just my two cents...trying to be helpful.</td>', 'Good color and detail.  What holds this image back is a lack of interest or context.  It''s not quite dramatic enough IMHO to get away with being an image about "form" or "light".  Granted, the nature of this odd challenge puts constraints on everyone, but some of the images others have presented still managed to add a bit more context or pop.  Just my two cents...trying to be helpful.', '2014-08-24 06:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254526, 1127376, 37858, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing this will not score especially high.  For me, the issue is the way the bird melts into the background rather than standing out either by blurring the background or using a lens with a higher focal point to get closer to the bird''s head.  Just my 2 cents...trying to be helpful.</td>', 'I''m guessing this will not score especially high.  For me, the issue is the way the bird melts into the background rather than standing out either by blurring the background or using a lens with a higher focal point to get closer to the bird''s head.  Just my 2 cents...trying to be helpful.', '2014-08-24 06:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254527, 1127396, 37858, '<td valign="top">Coming back to bump this one up.  It''s a nice slice of life kind of image with plenty to look at.</td>', 'Coming back to bump this one up.  It''s a nice slice of life kind of image with plenty to look at.', '2014-08-24 06:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254531, 1127565, 19944, '<td valign="top">I like the photo, but it seems a bit over sharpened for my taste</td>', 'I like the photo, but it seems a bit over sharpened for my taste', '2014-08-24 07:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254532, 1127435, 19944, '<td valign="top">I would have liked this better without the legs</td>', 'I would have liked this better without the legs', '2014-08-24 07:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254538, 1127587, 147314, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours and great use of DOF.</td>', 'Lovely colours and great use of DOF.', '2014-08-24 08:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254556, 1127346, 138630, '<td valign="top">Love this one - the space works and the silhouettes are clean and interesting.  I want to rotate ever so slightly to the right before I crop so I have the same narrow band of land on the left as on the right, but maybe that wasn''t possible.  I would also take out the pole (antenna?) on the left.  Picky, picky - double entendre :)  Gave this a 10 and it''s one of my top picks, maybe my top pick :)</td>', 'Love this one - the space works and the silhouettes are clean and interesting.  I want to rotate ever so slightly to the right before I crop so I have the same narrow band of land on the left as on the right, but maybe that wasn''t possible.  I would also take out the pole (antenna?) on the left.  Picky, picky - double entendre :)  Gave this a 10 and it''s one of my top picks, maybe my top pick :)', '2014-08-24 12:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254557, 1127562, 138630, '<td valign="top">Love this one and especially the long handle on the umbrella and the blowing hair and of course the beautifully dramatic sky.  Simple enough to work in this format and interesting enough to make it worth it.  I would have been very tempted to crop some off the top - about as much as the amount of earth you have.  Probably wouldn''t have since I''d have been going for the max 800 high, but now seeing some that were cropped, I think it wouldn''t have hurt at all.  10 and top two for me</td>', 'Love this one and especially the long handle on the umbrella and the blowing hair and of course the beautifully dramatic sky.  Simple enough to work in this format and interesting enough to make it worth it.  I would have been very tempted to crop some off the top - about as much as the amount of earth you have.  Probably wouldn''t have since I''d have been going for the max 800 high, but now seeing some that were cropped, I think it wouldn''t have hurt at all.  10 and top two for me', '2014-08-24 12:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254559, 1127027, 138630, '<td valign="top">Terrific natural abstract with great tones, lines, shapes.  9 from me</td>', 'Terrific natural abstract with great tones, lines, shapes.  9 from me', '2014-08-24 12:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254561, 1127483, 138630, '<td valign="top">Gotta love that glorious cloud with the crepuscular rays and the right half - almost 2/3 - of the image works well.  Overall, no matter how I stand or tilt my monitor, this is just a bit too dark for me, especially on the left.  9 for a beautiful scene that works well in the crop</td>', 'Gotta love that glorious cloud with the crepuscular rays and the right half - almost 2/3 - of the image works well.  Overall, no matter how I stand or tilt my monitor, this is just a bit too dark for me, especially on the left.  9 for a beautiful scene that works well in the crop', '2014-08-24 12:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254563, 1127401, 138630, '<td valign="top">Very pretty bird, lovely dof, love the diagonals of the branches and to have them repeated by the tail is super.  Nice one.  9</td>', 'Very pretty bird, lovely dof, love the diagonals of the branches and to have them repeated by the tail is super.  Nice one.  9', '2014-08-24 12:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254564, 1127279, 138630, '<td valign="top">Another scene that is perfectly gorgeous and works very well for the extreme crop but is just a bit too dark for me to be able to appreciate the layers of mountains.  Back and forth on this - absolutely a top pick and I may yet come back to bump it to the 10.  9 for now</td>', 'Another scene that is perfectly gorgeous and works very well for the extreme crop but is just a bit too dark for me to be able to appreciate the layers of mountains.  Back and forth on this - absolutely a top pick and I may yet come back to bump it to the 10.  9 for now', '2014-08-24 12:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254565, 1127516, 138630, '<td valign="top">Sell chosen subject that you have composed nicely.  The sky is perfect for the wind turbines, isn''t it?</td>', 'Sell chosen subject that you have composed nicely.  The sky is perfect for the wind turbines, isn''t it?', '2014-08-24 12:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254566, 1127260, 138630, '<td valign="top">So many tiny details to appreciate here.  Love the low horizon and the flock of birds that you were able to retain in the crop.</td>', 'So many tiny details to appreciate here.  Love the low horizon and the flock of birds that you were able to retain in the crop.', '2014-08-24 12:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254567, 1127364, 138630, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and the curving line of the branch works well.  I think I see some sensor spots and the background seems muddy or something.  Still a nice capture of a hummer.</td>', 'Nice shot and the curving line of the branch works well.  I think I see some sensor spots and the background seems muddy or something.  Still a nice capture of a hummer.', '2014-08-24 12:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254569, 1127549, 138630, '<td valign="top">Love the tones, the back lighting, the raised head and alert pose.  I would of course like to see the legs or else more foreground brush in that area so he doesn''t seem cut off by your crop but rather by his position in the scene.  The position in the frame seems awkward, too, with him looking more left but more space behind him.</td>', 'Love the tones, the back lighting, the raised head and alert pose.  I would of course like to see the legs or else more foreground brush in that area so he doesn''t seem cut off by your crop but rather by his position in the scene.  The position in the frame seems awkward, too, with him looking more left but more space behind him.', '2014-08-24 12:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254570, 1127466, 138630, '<td valign="top">Love the textures and colors and the peek through the open window that reveals nothing but suggests life in the room beyond.</td>', 'Love the textures and colors and the peek through the open window that reveals nothing but suggests life in the room beyond.', '2014-08-24 12:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254571, 1127283, 138630, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous waterfall and very nice job on it.  I would like to be able to see the figure better and I also wish his or her vest did not appear to be striped or padded - just something to think about another time if you have any control over the human subject at all :)</td>', 'Gorgeous waterfall and very nice job on it.  I would like to be able to see the figure better and I also wish his or her vest did not appear to be striped or padded - just something to think about another time if you have any control over the human subject at all :)', '2014-08-24 12:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254572, 1127098, 138630, '<td valign="top">Fantastic scene that is excellent for the crop, imo  Quite a bit too dark on my monitor no matter how I stand or tip it and that''s a shame.  Still a beauty.</td>', 'Fantastic scene that is excellent for the crop, imo  Quite a bit too dark on my monitor no matter how I stand or tip it and that''s a shame.  Still a beauty.', '2014-08-24 12:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254593, 1127496, 170281, '<td valign="top">Now that captures the essence of the challenge.  Well done!</td>', 'Now that captures the essence of the challenge.  Well done!', '2014-08-24 13:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254605, 1127562, 170281, '<td valign="top">Excellent!  Very nice imagery and sticking with the theme of the challenge.</td>', 'Excellent!  Very nice imagery and sticking with the theme of the challenge.', '2014-08-24 13:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254606, 1127582, 170281, '<td valign="top">Very well done.  The imagery of the one eye-closed and striking nature of B&amp;W make this a very appealing photo.</td>', 'Very well done.  The imagery of the one eye-closed and striking nature of B&W make this a very appealing photo.', '2014-08-24 13:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254608, 1127234, 170281, '<td valign="top">Very good shot of the moon.  I am not sure it was the best capture of the challenge theme.</td>', 'Very good shot of the moon.  I am not sure it was the best capture of the challenge theme.', '2014-08-24 13:58:06.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(7254609, 1127439, 170281, '<td valign="top">Credit to you for finding that slice that tells multiple stories.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Credit to you for finding that slice that tells multiple stories.  Nicely done.', '2014-08-24 14:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254619, 1127562, 118154, '<td valign="top">I enjoy this image.Boost.</td>', 'I enjoy this image.Boost.', '2014-08-24 14:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254620, 1127346, 118154, '<td valign="top">good stuff,one of my favs so far.boost.</td>', 'good stuff,one of my favs so far.boost.', '2014-08-24 14:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254621, 1127279, 118154, '<td valign="top">Another one for my top ten,thank you.boost.</td>', 'Another one for my top ten,thank you.boost.', '2014-08-24 14:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254623, 1127213, 118154, '<td valign="top">I like this,top ten please.</td>', 'I like this,top ten please.', '2014-08-24 14:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254635, 1127586, 138630, '<td valign="top">Very nice detail for the size.  You''d have sacrificed that if you''d been further away, but I think I would have liked it better if it felt less crowded and wasn''t cut off.  8</td>', 'Very nice detail for the size.  You''d have sacrificed that if you''d been further away, but I think I would have liked it better if it felt less crowded and wasn''t cut off.  8', '2014-08-24 14:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254636, 1127570, 30861, '<td valign="top">I find this incredibly poignant. Something about the tripartite composition, with the central, warped section walling off the figures from the flowers, defies its own stagnancy, seeming to underline a fundamental alienation. Or I''m just blowing happy smoke :-) But it works for me...</td>', 'I find this incredibly poignant. Something about the tripartite composition, with the central, warped section walling off the figures from the flowers, defies its own stagnancy, seeming to underline a fundamental alienation. Or I''m just blowing happy smoke :-) But it works for me...', '2014-08-24 14:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254637, 1127435, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is just terrific, what a layering of disparate elements... I wish you''d skewed the railing to square, but that''s just me being anal...</td>', 'This is just terrific, what a layering of disparate elements... I wish you''d skewed the railing to square, but that''s just me being anal...', '2014-08-24 14:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254638, 1127448, 30861, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done...</td>', 'Beautifully done...', '2014-08-24 14:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254640, 1127565, 103142, '<td valign="top">I like it, and I like the angle. But it''s looking a little oversharpened?</td>', 'I like it, and I like the angle. But it''s looking a little oversharpened?', '2014-08-24 14:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254641, 1127549, 103142, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning!!</td>', 'Absolutely stunning!!', '2014-08-24 14:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254642, 1127509, 103142, '<td valign="top">awesome!</td>', 'awesome!', '2014-08-24 14:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254643, 1127587, 103142, '<td valign="top">lovely!</td>', 'lovely!', '2014-08-24 14:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254654, 1127465, 138630, '<td valign="top">Liking this one a lot.  Funny how color can fill extra space beautifully :)</td>', 'Liking this one a lot.  Funny how color can fill extra space beautifully :)', '2014-08-24 15:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254655, 1127496, 138630, '<td valign="top">Terrific subject for this crop restriction.  The narrow vertical really emphasizes the height of the building and, therefore, gives us a sense of the size it must be.</td>', 'Terrific subject for this crop restriction.  The narrow vertical really emphasizes the height of the building and, therefore, gives us a sense of the size it must be.', '2014-08-24 15:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254656, 1127431, 138630, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition here - I enjoy the symmetry and the strong tonal range is good, too.</td>', 'Very nice composition here - I enjoy the symmetry and the strong tonal range is good, too.', '2014-08-24 15:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254657, 1127213, 138630, '<td valign="top">Love being able to see both hands.  The keyboard makes a nice focus point for this crop</td>', 'Love being able to see both hands.  The keyboard makes a nice focus point for this crop', '2014-08-24 15:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254658, 1127587, 138630, '<td valign="top">Stunning bokeh and what a pretty little bird.  I can only wish it was facing the other way - not a flip but having the bokeh in front of rather than behind the bird.  Still very pretty.</td>', 'Stunning bokeh and what a pretty little bird.  I can only wish it was facing the other way - not a flip but having the bokeh in front of rather than behind the bird.  Still very pretty.', '2014-08-24 15:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254659, 1127550, 138630, '<td valign="top">Nice detail for this much of a crop.</td>', 'Nice detail for this much of a crop.', '2014-08-24 15:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254660, 1127534, 138630, '<td valign="top">I like the shapes and design elements here and bw was a good choice to emphasize them.</td>', 'I like the shapes and design elements here and bw was a good choice to emphasize them.', '2014-08-24 15:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254661, 1127548, 138630, '<td valign="top">Good idea and nice and clean.  I''m not minding the shorter length but I think I would have put the pencil on a stronger diagonal so I could go longer.</td>', 'Good idea and nice and clean.  I''m not minding the shorter length but I think I would have put the pencil on a stronger diagonal so I could go longer.', '2014-08-24 15:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254662, 1127591, 138630, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped the sky off - I don''t see that you gained anything by keeping it in.  Either that or colored it blue so the building and sky blended together more.</td>', 'I would have cropped the sky off - I don''t see that you gained anything by keeping it in.  Either that or colored it blue so the building and sky blended together more.', '2014-08-24 15:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254663, 1127527, 138630, '<td valign="top">Good subject - a little too bright on the yellow for me.</td>', 'Good subject - a little too bright on the yellow for me.', '2014-08-24 15:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254664, 1127445, 138630, '<td valign="top">Cool.</td>', 'Cool.', '2014-08-24 15:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254665, 1127526, 138630, '<td valign="top">Nice title.</td>', 'Nice title.', '2014-08-24 15:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254666, 1127495, 38032, '<td valign="top">I dig it.</td>', 'I dig it.', '2014-08-24 15:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254668, 1127548, 149964, '<td valign="top">Like the simplicity of this but wasn''t sure it met the challenge.....</td>', 'Like the simplicity of this but wasn''t sure it met the challenge.....', '2014-08-24 16:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254669, 1127364, 149964, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of some 18th century wallpaper: delicate flowers and exotic birds. Lovely :-)</td>', 'This reminds me of some 18th century wallpaper: delicate flowers and exotic birds. Lovely :-)', '2014-08-24 16:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254679, 1127532, 138630, '<td valign="top">Nicely done - not easy to get this much of him in given the crop restrictions.  Centered is just right.</td>', 'Nicely done - not easy to get this much of him in given the crop restrictions.  Centered is just right.', '2014-08-24 17:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254687, 1127283, 8891, '<td valign="top">love the scale and composition.</td>', 'love the scale and composition.', '2014-08-24 17:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254694, 1127505, 144271, '<td valign="top">Beautiful symmetry</td>', 'Beautiful symmetry', '2014-08-24 18:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254695, 1127402, 144271, '<td valign="top">Lovely night shot</td>', 'Lovely night shot', '2014-08-24 18:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254696, 1127364, 144271, '<td valign="top">Looks like a postcard</td>', 'Looks like a postcard', '2014-08-24 18:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254697, 1127401, 144271, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors</td>', 'Beautiful colors', '2014-08-24 18:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254698, 1127586, 144271, '<td valign="top">Wonderful details and color</td>', 'Wonderful details and color', '2014-08-24 18:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254704, 1127234, 109227, '<td valign="top">A nice subject for this type of crop and it looks likes great shot of the moon.  I would like to see the whole moon rather than cutting it off on two ends.  (Voted earlier)</td>', 'A nice subject for this type of crop and it looks likes great shot of the moon.  I would like to see the whole moon rather than cutting it off on two ends.  (Voted earlier)', '2014-08-24 19:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254705, 1127213, 109227, '<td valign="top">An interesting perspective and nice tones.   The shallow depth of focus on the head is a little distracting to me. (Voted earlier)</td>', 'An interesting perspective and nice tones.   The shallow depth of focus on the head is a little distracting to me. (Voted earlier)', '2014-08-24 19:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254706, 1127572, 109227, '<td valign="top">Great choice for this crop and nice tones.  I think if the eyes were in better focus, this would really stand out. (Voted earlier)</td>', 'Great choice for this crop and nice tones.  I think if the eyes were in better focus, this would really stand out. (Voted earlier)', '2014-08-24 19:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254707, 1127570, 109227, '<td valign="top">Looks like a natural triptych.</td>', 'Looks like a natural triptych.', '2014-08-24 19:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254709, 1127118, 109227, '<td valign="top">Great composition and fits the crop well.</td>', 'Great composition and fits the crop well.', '2014-08-24 20:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
