(7254739, 1127567, 136989, '<td valign="top">I love the details and tones.  So much to look at in such a small space without being overwhelming.  My favorite in this challenge.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1082013" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/136989/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1082013.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/136989/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1082013.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/136989/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1082013.jpg"/></a></td>', 'I love the details and tones.  So much to look at in such a small space without being overwhelming.  My favorite in this challenge.', '2014-08-24 23:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254741, 1127402, 173844, '<td valign="top">The 160 limit is excellently utilized here.  The city glow, incorporating streetlights, lighthouse and palms, has a carnival atmosphere.  This is cunningly balanced by the preponderance of darkness to the left, artfully delineated by the slenderest necklace of lights on the horizon. The merest pixel of light further to the left anchors the entirety of the image to perfection.  My favorite entry in the challenge.</td>', 'The 160 limit is excellently utilized here.  The city glow, incorporating streetlights, lighthouse and palms, has a carnival atmosphere.  This is cunningly balanced by the preponderance of darkness to the left, artfully delineated by the slenderest necklace of lights on the horizon. The merest pixel of light further to the left anchors the entirety of the image to perfection.  My favorite entry in the challenge.', '2014-08-24 23:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
