(7254750, 1127117, 173844, '<td valign="top">A slice of layer cake sitting on a platter, with mysterious icing.  The moment is boiled down to its essence.  More substantial than it might appear.  Mucho calories, but delicious.</td>', 'A slice of layer cake sitting on a platter, with mysterious icing.  The moment is boiled down to its essence.  More substantial than it might appear.  Mucho calories, but delicious.', '2014-08-24 23:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
