(7254753, 1127118, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition.  The balance of figures, serpentine land and water, lush finger of grass and mellow sky come together to add up to more than the sum of its parts. The colors are beautiful and calm.  Superior to the HDR entry of the same locale.</td>', 'Lovely composition.  The balance of figures, serpentine land and water, lush finger of grass and mellow sky come together to add up to more than the sum of its parts. The colors are beautiful and calm.  Superior to the HDR entry of the same locale.', '2014-08-24 23:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254754, 1127570, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors used to water color effect.  The somewhat choppy movement from left to right well supports the mysterious ambiguity of the men exiting the image.  Coolly provocative.  I like it very much.</td>', 'Lovely colors used to water color effect.  The somewhat choppy movement from left to right well supports the mysterious ambiguity of the men exiting the image.  Coolly provocative.  I like it very much.', '2014-08-24 23:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254756, 1127559, 173844, '<td valign="top">Well, this tells a story.  The intimacy of this handsome image almost undercuts the momentous moment portrayed here.  That''s quite an achievement, and excellently offered to the viewer.</td>', 'Well, this tells a story.  The intimacy of this handsome image almost undercuts the momentous moment portrayed here.  That''s quite an achievement, and excellently offered to the viewer.', '2014-08-24 23:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
