(7254781, 1127533, 173844, '<td valign="top">This is the type of image I''d hoped to see in this challenge --  the artful truncation or eclipse that yields new insight into the subject and the novel distillation of form and rhythm.  Here we are compelled to consider the elegant, creamy, complicated structure of the swan''s upraised wing and the abstracted curve of its slender neck.  They are lovingly set off by the pattern of the darker background water.  Just wonderful.</td>', 'This is the type of image I''d hoped to see in this challenge --  the artful truncation or eclipse that yields new insight into the subject and the novel distillation of form and rhythm.  Here we are compelled to consider the elegant, creamy, complicated structure of the swan''s upraised wing and the abstracted curve of its slender neck.  They are lovingly set off by the pattern of the darker background water.  Just wonderful.', '2014-08-25 00:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
